Thread: &ReviewThread{Mode: ReviewThreadNew}},\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_brief.go:499:\t\treturn \", `prior_findings` (each with `id`, `status` and `evidence`, one for every finding of the previous round; the `id` is the identifier listed under Findings to account for, which carries its round, for example R2-F1, never a bare F1, and a finding you report now takes an `id` that no earlier round used, for example N1: a bare or reused identifier makes the whole draft unreadable) and `sweep` (what you swept)\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
